Antenna Designer is distributed under two licences, because it is two things.

  * The plugin -- everything in this repository except the simulator binary --
    is MIT licensed. That licence is below.

  * The simulator binary (`binaries/monopole`, `binaries/monopole.exe`, called
    the Solver) is proprietary. It is free for non-commercial use and is NOT
    covered by the MIT licence below. Its terms are in LICENSE-solver.txt,
    which travels with it in every package and install.

Third-party components keep their own licences: `antenna_plugin/vendor/three/`
is three.js r160, MIT, under its own notice.

